	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tua acepi omnia, reverende in Christo pater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>habeoque tibi gratias pro tua humanitate.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Nostris, ut grati sint, omnino insinuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Certe interea audivi ex <persName ref="p1770">Carlino</persName>, <foreign xml:lang="de">es sye uff dem triff,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quantum ipse colligit ex verbis, quae audivit ex <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ipsis <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pa[gicis]</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Deus avertat hoc malum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed orandus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>est dominus et vigilandum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernensibus</placeName> omnia<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>expedita esse audio, et illud ipsum <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pa[gos]</placeName> non <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>parum terret; nam a <persName>Sabaudo</persName> nunc nullum bellum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>timendum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Laborant hi homines multum de <persName ref="p293">Becaria</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>eiiciendo, eo nimirum consilio quo cętera, ut <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>omnia et apud nos perturbent; sed spero eos ludi<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ficatum iri.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Scripserunt <placeName ref="l2448">5 Pag[ici]</placeName> <placeName ref="l93">Superiori Foederi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>satis acerbe super hac re, et <persName ref="p1770">Carlinus</persName> affirmant <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>landtaman <persName>Dieterich Suitensemid</persName> ipsum apud <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>se verbis ursisse.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Gester ist ein bot mit briefen <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>kommen uß dem Oberen Pundt; die fünfzächner <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><foreign xml:lang="la">(ita appellant proceres <placeName ref="l93">Superioris Foederis</placeName>)</foreign> die schrybend, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sy vernemmend, das die <placeName ref="l2448">5 Ort</placeName> und <placeName ref="l176">Glarner</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nit wol gegen einander standind und ein <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>starckhe macht gegen einander haltind und <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>derhalben krieg ze besorgen sye; bittend unseren <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>senat, er wölle sy wyter berichten und angends <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ouch botten schicken, die helfind in der sach <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>handlen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Mittitur noster consul <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius</persName>, <foreign xml:lang="de">des <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName>Tschudiß</persName> schwaager.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scio nos ingratitudine <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nostra etiam extrema commeritos, sed <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>spero deum inter irascendum memorem futurum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>suae misericordiae.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><foreign xml:lang="la">Haec cum scriberem, venit famulus <persName>Herculis Salicis</persName>, non <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>illius <placeName ref="l93">Clavennensis</placeName>,</foreign> üwer götti der <persName>Heinrych</persName>, und sagt, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>es sye synem houptman zuͦgeschriben, es kämmind die <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>zwey fändli knächt gaan Rapelschwil zuͦm <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>zuͦsatz.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Der <persName>Hertli</persName> aber hat syn wyb von <placeName>Rappelschwil</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>die von <placeName>Marmels</placeName>, also das er guͦthe kundtschafft hat.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Sed an hoc verum sit, vos scitis; si verum est, ego <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>satis video, quo res tendat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nostri homines incipiunt <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>aegerrime ferre profectionem episcopi nostri nuperam <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>et illius cum Comense coniunctionem, propterea quod <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>intelligunt Comensem fabricatorem esse horum motuum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Novi nunc ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> nihil habemus; te rogo, reverende <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>in Christo pater, ut mature nos de statu vestro <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>et <placeName ref="l646">Glaronensium</placeName> edoceas.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Non cesso singulos prensare manu <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>et instituere; sed videtur <persName>Tschudius</persName> et hic habere suos <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>fautores.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Sed cum quaevis gens suam habeat mensuram, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>quae ad summum repleta redundare incipit, ita non <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>dubito feroculos istos in suum ipsorum incumbere interitum.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Deus nos suo auxilio dignetur et nostri misereatur.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">De <persName>Dario</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Darius Scala? (so Schieß). Eher: Dario Sozzini.</note> illo nec ego nec d. Philippus collega <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>quid certi habemus; a <placeName ref="l93">Clavennensibus</placeName> nos <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>edoceri oportet; sed sat scio quendam <persName>Ludovicum</persName> <placeName ref="l834">Italum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>diu apud os haesisse (qui nuper, cum <placeName ref="l93">Clavennae</placeName> non <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>reciperetur, denuo in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> rediit) eumque totum <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>fuisse <persName ref="p6589">Servetanum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Remitto scriptum vestrum <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>cum landtgravii, quod utrique nostrum mirum <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>in modum placet, et speramus id ipsum non cariturum suo <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>fructu.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale, reverende in Christo pater, e <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>d. <persName>Philippus</persName> et consul[es]<note type="misc">Cl od. CC.</note> salvere cupiunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> pridie <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>calendas octobris anno 1560.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z32"/>Tui observantissimus <lb xml:id="p2z33"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fab[ricius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Clarissimo viro eruditione et <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>pietate excellenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>antistiti vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>domino et patrono suo <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>multum honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>